IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-EARLY-EXIT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CURRENT-LAYER       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-LAYERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 RESIDUAL-DELTA-INT  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SHOULD-EXIT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-EARLY-EXIT.
    IF TOTAL-LAYERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 0 TO SHOULD-EXIT.
    MOVE TOTAL-LAYERS TO R14.
    DIVIDE 2 INTO R14.
    IF CURRENT-LAYER >= R14
        IF RESIDUAL-DELTA-INT < 10
            MOVE 1 TO SHOULD-EXIT.
        END-IF.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 SHOULD-EXIT.
    WEIGHT 30 CURRENT-LAYER.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 5.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
